{
  "data": {
    "id": "ROM.8.30-ROM.9.12",
    "orgId": "ROM.8.30-ROM.9.12",
    "bibleId": "7644de2e4c5188e5-01",
    "bookId": "ROM",
    "chapterIds": [
      "ROM.8",
      "ROM.9"
    ],
    "reference": "ΠΡΟΣ ΡΩΜΑΙΟΥΣ 8:30-9:12",
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "οὓς δὲ προώρισε, τούτους καὶ ἐκάλεσε· καὶ οὓς ἐκάλεσε, τούτους καὶ ἐδικαίωσεν· οὓς δὲ ἐδικαίωσε, τούτους καὶ ἐδόξασε.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.30"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "God's Love in Christ Jesus",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Τί οὖν ἐροῦμεν πρὸς ταῦτα; Εἰ ὁ Θεὸς ὑπὲρ ἡμῶν, τίς καθ᾽ ἡμῶν; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.31"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ὅς γε τοῦ ἰδίου υἱοῦ οὐκ ἐφείσατο, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.32"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἀλλ᾽ ὑπὲρ ἡμῶν πάντων παρέδωκεν αὐτόν, πῶς οὐχὶ καὶ σὺν αὐτῷ τὰ πάντα ἡμῖν χαρίσεται; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.32"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τίς ἐγκαλέσει κατὰ ἐκλεκτῶν Θεοῦ; Θεὸς ὁ δικαιῶν· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.33"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "τίς ὁ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "κατακρίνων; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Χριστὸς ὁ ἀποθανών, μᾶλλον δὲ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "καὶ ἐγερθείς, ὃς ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "καί ἐστιν ἐν δεξιᾷ τοῦ Θεοῦ, ὃς καὶ ἐντυγχάνει ὑπὲρ ἡμῶν. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.34"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τίς ἡμᾶς χωρίσει ἀπὸ τῆς ἀγάπης τοῦ Χριστοῦ; Θλίψις, ἢ στενοχωρία, ἢ διωγμός, ἢ λιμός, ἢ γυμνότης, ἢ κίνδυνος, ἢ μάχαιρα; ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.35"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Καθὼς γέγραπται ὅτι",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.36"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b",
          "vid": "ROM 8:36"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "ROM 8:36"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἕνεκέν σου θανατούμεθα ὅλην τὴν ἡμέραν·",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.36"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "q",
          "vid": "ROM 8:36"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "ἐλογίσθημεν ὡς πρόβατα σφαγῆς.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.36"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "b"
        },
        "items": []
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "m"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἀλλ᾽ ἐν τούτοις πᾶσιν ὑπερνικῶμεν διὰ τοῦ ἀγαπήσαντος ἡμᾶς. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.37",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.37"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Πέπεισμαι γὰρ ὅτι οὔτε θάνατος οὔτε ζωὴ οὔτε ἄγγελοι οὔτε ἀρχαὶ οὔτε ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.38",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.38"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "δυνάμεις οὔτε ἐνεστῶτα οὔτε μέλλοντα ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.38",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.38"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὔτε ὕψωμα οὔτε βάθος οὔτε τις κτίσις ἑτέρα δυνήσεται ἡμᾶς χωρίσαι ἀπὸ τῆς ἀγάπης τοῦ Θεοῦ τῆς ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ τῷ Κυρίῳ ἡμῶν.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.8.39",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.8.39"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "s"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "God's Choice of Israel",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Ἀλήθειαν λέγω ἐν Χριστῷ, οὐ ψεύδομαι, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "συμμαρτυρούσης μοι τῆς συνειδήσεώς μου ἐν Πνεύματι Ἁγίῳ, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὅτι λύπη μοί ἐστι μεγάλη, καὶ ἀδιάλειπτος ὀδύνη τῇ καρδίᾳ μου. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Εὐχόμην γὰρ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "αὐτὸς ἐγὼ ἀνάθεμα εἶναι ἀπὸ τοῦ Χριστοῦ ὑπὲρ τῶν ἀδελφῶν μου, τῶν συγγενῶν μου κατὰ σάρκα· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οἵτινές εἰσιν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἰσραηλῖται, ὧν ἡ υἱοθεσία καὶ ἡ δόξα καὶ αἱ διαθῆκαι καὶ ἡ νομοθεσία καὶ ἡ λατρεία καὶ αἱ ἐπαγγελίαι, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ὧν οἱ πατέρες, καὶ ἐξ ὧν ὁ Χριστὸς τὸ κατὰ σάρκα, ὁ ὢν ἐπὶ πάντων, Θεὸς εὐλογητὸς εἰς τοὺς αἰῶνας. Ἀμήν.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.5"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Οὐχ οἷον δὲ ὅτι ἐκπέπτωκεν ὁ λόγος τοῦ Θεοῦ. Οὐ γὰρ πάντες οἱ ἐξ Ἰσραήλ, οὗτοι Ἰσραήλ· ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "οὐδ᾽ ὅτι εἰσὶ σπέρμα Ἀβραάμ, πάντες τέκνα· ἀλλ᾽ Ἐν Ἰσαὰκ κληθήσεταί σοι σπέρμα. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Τοῦτ᾽ ἔστιν, οὐ τὰ τέκνα τῆς σαρκός, ταῦτα τέκνα τοῦ Θεοῦ· ἀλλὰ τὰ τέκνα τῆς ἐπαγγελίας λογίζεται εἰς σπέρμα. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Ἐπαγγελίας γὰρ ὁ λόγος οὗτος, Κατὰ τὸν καιρὸν τοῦτον ἐλεύσομαι, καὶ ἔσται τῇ Σάρρᾳ υἱός. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "Οὐ μόνον δέ, ἀλλὰ καὶ Ῥεβέκκα ἐξ ἑνὸς κοίτην ἔχουσα, Ἰσαὰκ τοῦ πατρὸς ἡμῶν— ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "μήπω γὰρ γεννηθέντων, μηδὲ πραξάντων τι ἀγαθὸν ἢ ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "κακόν, ἵνα ἡ κατ᾽ ἐκλογὴν ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "πρόθεσις τοῦ Θεοῦ μένῃ, οὐκ ἐξ ἔργων, ἀλλ᾽ ἐκ τοῦ καλοῦντος, ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "ἐρρήθη αὐτῇ ὅτι Ὁ μείζων δουλεύσει τῷ ἐλάσσονι. ",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "ROM.9.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "ROM.9.12"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verseCount": 22,
    "copyright": "Public Domain",
    "parallels": [
      {
        "id": "ROM.8.30-ROM.9.12",
        "orgId": "ROM.8.30-ROM.9.12",
        "bibleId": "de4e12af7f28f599-01",
        "bookId": "ROM",
        "chapterIds": [
          "ROM.8",
          "ROM.9"
        ],
        "reference": "Romans 8:30-9:12",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Moreover whom he did predestinate, them he also called: and whom he called, them he also justified: and whom he justified, them he also glorified. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.30",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.30"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "What shall we then say to these things? If God ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.31"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "be",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.31"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " for us, who ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.31"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "can be",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.31"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " against us? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.31",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.31"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "He that spared not his own Son, but delivered him up for us all, how shall he not with him also freely give us all things? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.32",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.32"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Who shall lay any thing to the charge of God’s elect? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.33"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "It is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.33"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " God that justifieth. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.33",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.33"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Who ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.34"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.34"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " he that condemneth? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.34"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "It is",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.34"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " Christ that died, yea rather, that is risen again, who is even at the right hand of God, who also maketh intercession for us. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.34",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.34"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Who shall separate us from the love of Christ? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.35"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "shall",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.8.35"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " tribulation, or distress, or persecution, or famine, or nakedness, or peril, or sword? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.35",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.35"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "As it is written, For thy sake we are killed all the day long; we are accounted as sheep for the slaughter. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.36",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.36"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Nay, in all these things we are more than conquerors through him that loved us. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.37",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.37"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For I am persuaded, that neither death, nor life, nor angels, nor principalities, nor powers, nor things present, nor things to come, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.38",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.38"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Nor height, nor depth, nor any other creature, shall be able to separate us from the love of God, which is in Christ Jesus our Lord.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.8.39",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.8.39"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "I say the truth in Christ, I lie not, my conscience also bearing me witness in the Holy Ghost, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.9.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "That I have great heaviness and continual sorrow in my heart. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.9.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.9.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "For I could wish that myself were accursed from Christ for my brethren, my kinsmen according to the flesh: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.9.3"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Who are Israelites; to whom ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.9.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "pertaineth",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "ROM.9.4"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": " the adoption, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the service ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "ROM.9.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "of God",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
